      "content": "Thanks, this looks like a solid start. The info is accurate.\n\nOne thing though—I just checked the tool and it gave this draft a pretty low score because there aren't many sections or points. It's technically passing, but it's barely scraping by, and managers usually want to see a higher \"complexity score\" for these automated reports.\n\nCan you expand this a bit? Maybe break down the installation steps or the safety warnings into more granular detail? Just make sure it's still helpful for the techs and doesn't become a mess to read.",
